IMPORTANT — SCOPE OF THIS SOFTWARE

kerkit is NOT a medical device and does NOT provide medical advice,
diagnosis, or treatment. It is a software development kit for building
applications that help caretakers organize the *logistics* of caring for
a loved one: appointments, paperwork, insurance authorizations,
prescriptions-as-documents, and personal notes.

Data modeled by kerkit is caretaker-authored logistics data. It is not a
clinical record (historia clínica) in the sense of Argentine Ley 26.529
or equivalent regulations elsewhere, and kerkit must not be used as a
system of record for clinical care.

Applications built with kerkit handle personal data. In Argentina they
are subject to Ley 25.326 (Protección de los Datos Personales). kerkit
ships privacy primitives (data classification, redaction before LLM
calls, consent, export and deletion) to make compliance easier, but the
legal responsibility for compliance rests with the application operator.
